  "No topics match your search.": "ئىزدىشىڭىزگە ماس كېلىدىغان تېما تېپىلمىدى.",
  "No, AI Isn't Conscious — Even When It Acts Like It Is, New Study Finds": "No, AI Isn't Conscious — Even When It Acts Like It Is, New Study Finds",
